  "notes": [
    "Fully regular reflexive -AR verb; follows standard endings throughout",
    "The reflexive form is typically reciprocal: *se saludan con dos besos* = they greet each other with two kisses",
    "Non-reflexive *saludar* = to greet someone: *Saluda a tu madre de mi parte* = Say hello to your mother from me",
    "Past participle: saludado (regular)",
    "*En España se saludan con dos besos* = In Spain they greet each other with two kisses",
    "*Los argentinos se saludan con un beso* = Argentinians greet each other with one kiss",
    "Related: el saludo (greeting), saludar (to greet), ¡Saludos! (regards/greetings)"
